<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F5F0E8; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; }
        .wrapper { background-color: #F5F0E8; padding: 40px 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #FDFAF5; border: 1px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.15); border-radius: 0; overflow: hidden; border-top: 2px solid #B89140; }
        .header { text-align: center; padding: 40px 40px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.2); }
        .logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 300; color: #B89140; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; display: block; }
        .content { padding: 35px 40px; }
        h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 25px; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1.2; }
        h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; margin: 25px 0 12px; font-weight: 600; border-left: 4px solid #B89140; padding-left: 12px; }
        p { color: #000000; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
        .text-muted { color: #6B5F4E; }
        table.details { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 15px 0; }
        table.details td { padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.1); }
        table.details .label { color: #A97C50; font-weight: 500; width: 45%; }
        table.details .value { color: #000000; font-weight: 600; }
        table.totals { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 10px 0; }
        table.totals td { padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,161,74,0.1); }
        table.totals .total-row td { background: #F5F0E8; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; border-bottom: none; }
        table.totals .total-amount { color: #B89140; }
        .btn-cta { display: inline-block; background-color: #B89140; color: #FDFAF5; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        .btn-wrapper { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 10px; }
        .divider { height: 1px; background-color: rgba(201,161,74,0.2); margin: 30px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 25px 40px; }
        .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #A97C50; margin: 0 0 6px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .footer .brand { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #B89140; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <a href="https://pavillonleslys.com" class="logo">PAVILLON LES LYS</a>
            </div>

            <div class="content">
                <h1>Votre Contrat</h1>

                <p>Bonjour {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</p>

                <p>Veuillez trouver ci-joint votre contrat pour votre événement au Pavillon Les Lys.</p>

                <h3>Détails du dossier</h3>
                <table class="details">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">N° Dossier</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.folderNumber}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Type d'événement</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.eventType}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Date de début</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.start}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Date de fin</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.end}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Nombre d'invités</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.attendees}}</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                <h3>Montants</h3>
                <table class="totals">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">Total HT</td>
                        <td class="value">{{folder.totalHT}} FCFA</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="total-row">
                        <td>Total TTC</td>
                        <td class="total-amount">{{folder.totalTTC}} FCFA</td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

                {{#if folder.notes}}
                <h3>Notes</h3>
                <p class="text-muted">{{folder.notes}}</p>
                {{/if}}

                <div class="btn-wrapper">
                    <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn-cta">Voir mon dossier</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p class="brand">Pavillon Les Lys — Excellence & Convivialité</p>
                <p>Riviera Palmeraie, Abidjan — Côte d'Ivoire</p>
                <p><em>Ce message est automatique, merci de ne pas y répondre directement.</em></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>